  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help baby Maryam with her  heart surgery!</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Maryam is only months old, yet she suffers from the swelling of the heart. She is need of urgent surgery, but her weight does not qualify for a safe procedure, therefore Maryam is undergoing a weight gaining treatment. But recently she was admitted to the intensive care because of failure to breathe. To compund her ordeal, her father, the provider of the family, suffered a stroke and currently disabled.  We are inviting you to lend your hand to help Maryam battle her disease, and help her family</narrative>
  </description>
